  "invariants": {
    "status": "present",
    "value": [
      "Maintain orders by unique ID. place creates live orders; pause accepts live, resume accepts paused, cancel accepts live/paused, complete accepts live. Other transitions return false. listLive(currency) returns fresh live snapshots by timestamp then ID, optionally filtering currency. Terminal IDs cannot be reused.",
      "Observing a result must not change earlier returned snapshots or mutate input containers."
    ],
